    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.book-hours.what": "在现场工时单上,将机械工时与同一班组的人工工时一并计入项目。",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.book-hours.why": "未计入项目的设备永远不会出现在成本报告中。将其与人工一并记录,才能得到工作的真实成本。",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.maintenance.in.hours": "机器工时与日期",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.maintenance.in.intervals": "保养间隔",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.maintenance.out.alerts": "检验提醒",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.maintenance.out.flags": "保养到期标记",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.maintenance.title": "标记检验和保养",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.maintenance.what": "根据工时和日期,标记即将到期需要法定检验或保养的机械。",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.maintenance.why": "未经检验的吊装设备或超期未保养的机械是停工和安全风险。提前标记能让设备保持合规并正常运转。",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.register.in.hired": "租赁合同",
