    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.report.out.report": "使用率报告",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.report.title": "报告使用率和闲置设备",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.report.what": "报告整个机队的使用率和闲置时间,让你看清哪些设备在创造价值、哪些在闲置。",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.step.report.why": "闲置的租赁设备每天都在烧钱。使用率数据能告诉你该退租什么、该调走什么,而不是靠猜测。",
    "cases.manage_the_plant_and_equipment_register.title": "管理机械设备登记",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.desc": "打开当前图纸版本,添加批注供设计团队查看,并将新版本与已作废版本叠加对比,准确看出改动内容和位置。",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.compare.in.new": "新版本",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.compare.in.old": "已作废版本",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.compare.out.changes": "高亮改动内容",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.compare.out.overlay": "版本叠加图",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.compare.title": "与旧版本对比",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.compare.what": "将新版本叠加在已作废图纸上,让工具高亮每一条位置有变的线条,这样你看到的是真实的改动,而不是仅仅依赖修订云线。",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.compare.why": "设计团队并不总是将所有改动都用云线标出。看到真实差异,才能避免一处悄悄改动的尺寸因无人察觉而被错误施工。",
    "cases.mark_up_and_compare_a_drawing_revision.step.open.in.files": "项目图纸文件",
