    "cases.run_a_handover_acceptance_inspection.step.defects.title": "清空缺陷清单",
    "cases.run_a_handover_acceptance_inspection.step.defects.what": "将每一项不合格项转为整改清单条目,标注位置、责任人和截止日期,分发给相应责任专业,并跟踪清单直至清零后再宣告完成。",
    "cases.run_a_handover_acceptance_inspection.step.defects.why": "缺陷清单正是实质完工与真正验收之间的确切差距,客户对每一项未完成事项都感受得到。清零通常正是获得验收及相应付款的关键。",
    "cases.run_a_handover_acceptance_inspection.step.inspect.in.criteria": "验收标准",
    "cases.run_a_handover_acceptance_inspection.step.inspect.in.works": "已完工工程",
    "cases.run_a_handover_acceptance_inspection.step.inspect.out.record": "检查记录",
    "cases.run_a_handover_acceptance_inspection.step.inspect.out.results": "合格/不合格结果",
    "cases.run_a_handover_acceptance_inspection.step.inspect.title": "开展验收检查",
    "cases.run_a_handover_acceptance_inspection.step.inspect.what": "按区域逐一对照约定的验收标准检查工程,为每项标注合格或不合格,附上说明和照片,并记录出席人员及所见情况。",
    "cases.run_a_handover_acceptance_inspection.step.inspect.why": "依据书面标准进行的结构化检查,取代了双方各执一词的模糊巡视。共同认可、有据可查的记录,能防止验收日后演变成争执。",
    "cases.run_a_handover_acceptance_inspection.title": "开展交付验收检查",
    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.desc": "主持现场进度会议,记录各项决定,将其转化为有责任人的行动项或问询单,然后发出会议纪要。",
    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.actions.in.decisions": "已记录决定",
    "cases.run_a_progress_meeting_and_drive_the_actions.step.actions.in.owners": "已指定责任人",
